Z||000000||Deer_Slayer||04-04-2000||11:32 AM||||On this Fiero of mine, I've noticed that even though in has the 2.5, it has the 6 cylinder pipes.  It's an 86 SE.  Does anyone else have a car with this feature?||||reg||5
